ti_petroglyphs]; The images include deer [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trialeti_petroglyphs]; The images include horses [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trialeti_petroglyphs]; The images include fantastic and hybrid creatures [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trialeti_petroglyphs]; The images include diminutive hunters [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trialeti_petroglyphs]; The hunters carry bows and arrows [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trialeti_petroglyphs]"}]'::jsonb),
