D: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leaze_stone_circle]; The stones are squarish in shape [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leaze_stone_circle]; The circle is cut through the centre by a hedge [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leaze_stone_circle]; The circle may once have had twenty two stones [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leaze_stone_circle]"}]'::jsonb),
